      "text": "CRC Api Endpoints:\nPOST: /10b51/createNewPlan\nPOST: /10b51/updatePlan\nPOST: /10b51/deletePlan\nPOST: /10b51/savePlan\nPOST: /10b51/getAllPlans {paginated}\n\nPOST: /10b51/ApprovePLan {planId: }\nPOSt: /10b51/getReports {[planId:]}",
