      "updated": 1768759413541,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "10b51 Trade Engine(TTE) and Recon\n- read shares marked for sell \n- runs every 4 hours \n- new rules implementations\n- recon job for order mismatch\n- tax recalcualtion on each run \n- mark and sweep success to move to next state by TTE.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "10b51 Trade Engine(TTE) and Recon\n- read shares marked for sell \n- runs every 4 hours \n- new rules implementations\n- recon job for order mismatch\n- tax recalcualtion on each run \n- mark and sweep success to move to next state by TTE.",
